  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/1"/>Adonoy has begun His reign,<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/2"/>with majesty He has clothed Himself;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/3"/>Adonoy clothed Himself,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/4"/>with strength He has girded Himself;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/5"/>He has firmly established the world,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/6"/>so that it cannot be moved.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/7"/>Your throne stands firm from of old,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/8"/>You are from eternity.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/9"/>The rivers have raised—Adonoy—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/10"/>the rivers have raised their voice,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/11"/>the rivers raise their raging waves.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/12"/>More than the roar of many waters,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/13"/>mightier than the breakers of the sea,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/14"/>mighty on high are You "Adonoy."
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/15"/>Your testimonies are extremely faithful;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/16"/>holiness is becoming to Your House,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/93/17"/>Adonoy,—for the length of days.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
  <tei:standOff type="notes">
    <tei:note type="commentary" target="#note_1" xml:lang="en">
      <tei:p>On the sixth day, the Levites sang Psalm 93, “Adonoy has begun his reign, with majesty He has clothed Himself,” because He completed the work of creation and reigned over all His creatures.—<tei:hi rend="italic">Maseches Rosh Hashana</tei:hi> 31a</tei:p>
    </tei:note>
  </tei:standOff>
